<section class="section white-100">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="section-badge">
                <div>FAQ</div>
              </div>
              <h2 class="section-heading center">Questions, answered</h2>
              <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                <p class="font-regular center">Everything you need to know before booking your plumbing service.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-wrap">
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">How long does a project like this take?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Most domestic projects on this scale run between two and five working days. You get a day-by-day schedule before we start, and if anything shifts you hear it from us rather than discovering it.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Will we be without water while you work?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Rarely for long. We stage the work so at least one bathroom and the kitchen stay usable, and any full isolation is agreed with you in advance.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Do you make good the floors and walls?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Yes. Reinstatement is priced into the quote from the start, covering plaster, screed, tiling and any driveway surface we had to open.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Can I see progress while the job runs?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Of course. Your engineer walks you through what was done at the end of each day, and we photograph anything that is about to be closed back up.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Is the finished work guaranteed?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Every project carries a twelve-month guarantee on parts and labour, plus the manufacturer’s own warranty on anything we install.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">How do I get a quote for my project?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Send a few photographs and a short description through the contact form. We come back with an indicative range, then arrange a site visit to firm it up.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
